	'ip_contact_lede' => 'The Hozue Food Festival office is based in Alderford, coordinating arrangements for our sixty-four stalls, eighteen winemakers, and festival guests. Please get in touch using the details below for general questions or stallholder administration.',
	'ip_contact_s1_b' => 'Our central festival office manages all inquiries for the upcoming weekend on Saturday 11 and Sunday 12 September 2027. You can reach our administrative team by telephone at +00 44 2081 6630 during weekday business hours, or send an email directly to hello@hozuefestival.example. If you are an independent grower, baker, or vintner seeking stallholder information, or if you need to arrange ticket transfers or accessibility passes, please address your correspondence to our stallholder coordinator, Aiko Brennan. Aiko oversees all vendor logistics, gate passes, and accessibility requests for Hozue Riverside Park.',
