	'ip_getting-here_s1_b' => 'The festival is held at Hozue Riverside Park, Weir Lane, Alderford. Saturday opening hours run from 11:00 to 21:00, while Sunday runs from 11:00 to 18:00. Ticket holders enjoy advance entry through the main gates starting thirty minutes earlier, at 10:30 on both mornings. The main entrance and box office desk are situated directly on Weir Lane, adjacent to the riverside footbridge. We encourage visitors to arrive early to enjoy the morning market stalls and avoid peak afternoon foot traffic along the riverbank path.',
	'ip_getting-here_s1_h' => 'Address and Opening Hours',
	'ip_getting-here_s2_b' => 'Reaching the festival grounds using public transport is straightforward. Alderford railway station is an eight-minute signposted walk from the Weir Lane gate, with regular regional trains running throughout the weekend. Visitors travelling by bicycle can cross the scenic footbridge over the river, where secure temporary bike racks are provided right beside the entrance. If you are travelling by car, designated parking is located in the signposted meadow north of Weir Lane. Spaces are limited, so we strongly encourage car sharing or taking public rail connections into Alderford.',
