	'ip_newsletter_s1_b' => 'Joining our festival waitlist gives you priority access to news and ticket milestones before general announcements. First, you receive immediate notification before early-bird pricing closes on Friday 30 April 2027, ensuring you secure day passes at €24 or weekend passes at €40 before rates increase. Second, waitlist subscribers receive the full producer directory for all sixty-four stalls and eighteen winemakers as soon as it is confirmed. Third, you gain early access to reserve places for the Saturday long-table lunch at 13:00, which has limited seating along the riverbank and regularly fills up in advance.',
	'ip_newsletter_s1_h' => 'Three Reasons to Join the Waitlist',
