	'ip_privacy_h1' => 'Privacy Policy',
	'ip_privacy_lede' => 'This privacy statement explains how Hozue Food Festival collects, manages, and protects your personal information when you use our website or purchase tickets. We are committed to handling your data with transparency, care, and full confidentiality.',
	'ip_privacy_s1_b' => 'When you purchase festival tickets or tasting passes, we collect only the necessary details required to process your transaction and issue your entry credentials. This includes your name, email address, billing address, and payment information. Payment transactions are processed securely through certified financial gateways, and we do not store full credit card details on festival servers. Your email address is used solely to transmit your digital e-ticket within ten minutes of purchase, provide essential pre-festival updates, and verify admission wristbands at the Weir Lane entrance to Hozue Riverside Park.',
	'ip_privacy_s1_h' => 'Personal Data Collected for Ticket Orders',
	'ip_privacy_s2_b' => 'If you choose to subscribe to our newsletter or join the festival waitlist, your email address is retained securely to deliver occasional updates about the 11–12 September 2027 weekend. We never sell, rent, or distribute personal data to third-party commercial organisations or advertising networks. You have the right to request a copy of the personal information we hold about you, request corrections, or ask for complete deletion of your records. For all data protection inquiries or deletion requests, please contact our festival office at hello@hozuefestival.example.',
